failed liveness probe(object, observation time) -> may evict
    First failure starts a suspicion window.
    Repeated failure after the reconnect grace permits eviction.
successful liveness probe(object)
    Clear suspicion so a later interruption starts a new window.

recoveredWorkspace: find the sole registered builtin workspace among pinned roots; exclude dead entries and unpinned workspaces; report ambiguity when multiple main roots survive.
